WEBVTT

00:00:00.359 --> 00:00:03.054
This is a fictional training example. The message

00:00:03.234 --> 00:00:06.108
asks why an order is delayed and includes

00:00:06.198 --> 00:00:10.375
contact details and a personal family circumstance. Start

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:13.024
with the task: draft an acknowledgment using the

00:00:13.069 --> 00:00:16.520
supplied policy. Inventory the information by category without

00:00:16.699 --> 00:00:20.472
copying real records. The order-delay issue serves the

00:00:20.517 --> 00:00:23.999
drafting task. The family circumstance does not. A

00:00:24.043 --> 00:00:26.828
real order reference might serve an authorized lookup,

00:00:27.053 --> 00:00:29.298
but it is unnecessary for this fictional drafting

00:00:29.434 --> 00:00:32.038
exercise. Do not assume that having the full

00:00:32.083 --> 00:00:34.760
email grants permission to upload it. Save the

00:00:34.804 --> 00:00:37.544
classification and the reason each category is needed

00:00:37.768 --> 00:00:38.751
or removed.
